WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.400
Listen and type the whole sentence. Pay attention to the verb ending.

2
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:16.300
It is easy to type “she go”: with she the verb takes -es. “go to bed” means to go to sleep.

3
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:22.300
“She goes to bed at eleven.” Writing 11 is also accepted.
